{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \r\n\r\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete\r\nGO:0036234 deglucuronidation\r\n GO:0036235 acyl deglucuronidation\r\n GO:0036236 acyl glucuronidation\r\n GO:0018411 protein glucuronidation\r\n GO:0018412 protein O-glucuronidation\r\n GO:0052695 cellular glucuronidation\r\n GO:0036236 acyl glucuronidation\r\n GO:2001030 negative regulation of cellular glucuronidation\r\n GO:2001031 positive regulation of cellular glucuronidation\r\n GO:2001029 regulation of cellular glucuronidation\r\n GO:0052697 xenobiotic glucuronidation\r\nas they are BP terms for MFs.\r\n\r\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/28506.\r\n\r\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \r\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/12LJ9kWnpqwrppju_HKLm_gp4LwRf3z7CYGE22sEvGsk/edit?gid=0#gid=0\r\n\r\nImpacted groups: \r\nRGD\t6 ~done\r\nBHF-UCL\t19 -done\r\nReactome\t5 ~done\r\nUniProt\t37 done\r\nComplexPortal\t8\r\n\r\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\r\n----\r\n\r\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \r\n[LIST IDs + ADD ASSIGNEES] \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks.\r\n", "created_at": "2024-11-25T23:38:46Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0052695 cellular glucuronidation and related terms", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-03-31T07:03:16Z"}
